Package: gtheoryr
Type: Package
Title: Simple Generalizability Theory for Crossed and Nested Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Ujjwal",
      family = "Tyagi",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "ujjwaltyagiii@gmail.com"
    )
  )
Description: Provides a small, beginner-friendly interface for estimating
    variance components in simple generalizability theory designs. The package
    currently supports a fully crossed persons-by-items design and a simple
    items-within-person nested design, along with design-study summaries for
    relative and absolute decisions.
